Trimmed real data, fetched 2026-09-26 (ruling T1: Homebrew is an open source;
small trimmed real fixtures are allowed). Rows were only removed, and fields
dropped where noted; no value was changed.

- http/cask-install-{30d,90d,365d}.json: rows of
  https://formulae.brew.sh/api/analytics/cask-install/{30d,90d,365d}.json,
  Homebrew's aggregate install analytics. The formulae.brew.sh site is
  BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2009-present, Homebrew contributors; see
  https://github.com/Homebrew/formulae.brew.sh and https://docs.brew.sh/Analytics.
  The analytics data itself states no licence.
- http/tree-*.json, http/commits-*.json, http/cask_renames.json: from the
  GitHub API and raw files of https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-cask
  (BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2013 Paul Hinze & Contributors). The tree
  listings keep only the casks used here; the commit lists keep only each
  commit's sha and committer date (no names or emails).
- snapshot/ and expected.jsonl are derived from those files by the collector.
